      420.03,
      313.9
    ],
    "reading_order": 12,
    "text": "In (1) and (2) above, is F not the same as ‘not E’? Yes, it is. We denote the event",
    "latex": null,
    "image_ref": null,
    "confidence": 1.0
  },
